    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You brandish the weapon used to cast the spell and choose a point within range. Hundreds of spectral copies of it (or of ammunition suited to it) rain down in a volley and then vanish. Each creature of your choice that you can see in a 40-foot-radius, 20-foot-high Cylinder centered on that point makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 8d8 Force damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p>",
